# Copy this file to ".env.local" and paste a GitHub token to fix the
# 60-requests/hour unauthenticated rate limit. One token powers everything:
#   • your project cards          (GitHub REST API)
#   • your avatar / profile       (GitHub REST API)
#   • the contribution graph 473  (GitHub GraphQL API)
#
# How to create the token:
#   1. Go to https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta  (or "Tokens (classic)")
#   2. Classic token → scopes: read:user  (and public_repo if you want private repo metadata)
#   3. Copy it and paste below, then restart the dev server.
#
# NEVER commit .env.local — it is already in .gitignore.

GH_CONTRIB_TOKEN=ghp_paste_your_token_here
